# Copy to .env (git-ignored). For the LOCAL stack, `npm run env:local` writes this file for you.
# For a Supabase cloud project: Project settings > API > Project URL and the "anon" / publishable key.
# The anon key is PUBLIC (it ships to every browser). Security comes from Row Level Security, not from hiding it.
# NEVER put the service_role or secret key here: it bypasses all security.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
